# Build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
artifacts/

# Smoke tools render PNGs beside themselves; they are evidence for a handover, not source.
tools/**/*.png

# Local QA renders and measurement output are evidence for a handover, not source.
/scratch/

# Store listing art is rendered from tools/store-listing-art by render.cjs, and the zip
# is just those files bundled for the submission form. Both are outputs; the page that
# produces them is the source and it is tracked.
StorePackage/ListingAssets/
StorePackage/*.zip

# IDE
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# Signing material must never be committed. The certificate lives on a hardware token
# and tools/sign-release.ps1 reads it by thumbprint, so nothing here should ever appear.
# This is a backstop, not a workflow.
*.pfx
*.p12
*.snk
*.pem

# Smoke tools write here when "--replace" is passed as a positional path by mistake.
/--replace
/--replace-*
**/--replace/
